{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kunoichi Beat is a pseudo 8-bit, quasi-cinematic platformer with minor stealth elements and visual novel-style storytelling. Playing as an urban ninja, much of the platforming is parkour-influenced as players will be making use of the environment with the urban ninja\u2019s (slightly over-exaggerated) realistic jumping abilities. There are also several enemies with varying attack patterns to overcome along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several parkour-inspired, retro-styled platforming challenges with minor stealth and puzzle elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemies with their own attack patterns to overcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel-style storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pseudo 8-bit, pixel-art visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lofi, jazzy hip-hop soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-styled gaming experience with a dream-like, abstract vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Xbox Series, Xbox One, and Xbox 360 Controllers (recommended)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chapter 01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387990/011b025ca353de313aafec5d52f412da1e9de921.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 02","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387990/2f596aaff80c4f9a1e84a7f1b2e45dafbdf6d4ab.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 03","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387990/93cfed8dbd2ea34cfc1aab19d8ca44dd69d01896.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 04","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387990/5d88712c0a702132dd64d4fc2c738e6f67487205.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 05","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387990/df2e207968d813c2990